        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dual Eclipse</strong></i> is a <strong>shortform trick-taking RPG</strong> about restoring order to the cosmos by seeking out and defeating a Prismatic Dragon that is attempting to consume the Moon and Sun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three classes to explore mysterious dungeons, evade dangerous traps, uncover powerful treasure, and discover secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TRICK-TAKING COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.poster.avif?t=1777745803\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.webm?t=1777745803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.mp4?t=1777745803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snappy trick-taking combat!</strong> Think of it like fencing with cards! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry cards!</strong> A tactical choice that offers high risk, high reward opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your cards are your equipment! </strong>Card don't just have effects, they're how you fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique combos</strong> encourage interesting choices and dynamic combat.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR DECK, CRAFT CARDS, AND GROW STRONGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.poster.avif?t=1777745803\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.webm?t=1777745803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.mp4?t=1777745803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Loot cards </strong> by defeating enemies and finding treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft cards</strong> that empower your build. Need a shield to go with that sword? Craft it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Level up</strong> and specialize your class! Make your defense your best offense as the Paladin, specialize in bows as the Rogue, or command frost as the Wizard!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dual Eclipse</strong></i> is a <strong>shortform trick-taking RPG</strong> about restoring order to the cosmos by seeking out and defeating a Prismatic Dragon that is attempting to consume the Moon and Sun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three classes to explore mysterious dungeons, evade dangerous traps, uncover powerful treasure, and discover secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TRICK-TAKING COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.poster.avif?t=1777745803\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.webm?t=1777745803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.mp4?t=1777745803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snappy trick-taking combat!</strong> Think of it like fencing with cards! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry cards!</strong> A tactical choice that offers high risk, high reward opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your cards are your equipment! </strong>Card don't just have effects, they're how you fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique combos</strong> encourage interesting choices and dynamic combat.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR DECK, CRAFT CARDS, AND GROW STRONGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.poster.avif?t=1777745803\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.webm?t=1777745803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.mp4?t=1777745803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Loot cards </strong> by defeating enemies and finding treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft cards</strong> that empower your build. Need a shield to go with that sword? Craft it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Level up</strong> and specialize your class! Make your defense your best offense as the Paladin, specialize in bows as the Rogue, or command frost as the Wizard!</p></li></ul>",
